&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Anas, full-stack Next.js developer building SaaS products and premium templates. X: &lt;a href="https://x.com/ASheikh69751" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;@ASheikh69751&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
